{
  "version": "7.3",
  "data_api_version": "3.0",
  "routing_model": {
    "FIND_TAG": [
      "CLAIM_SUMMARY"
    ],
    "CLAIM_SUMMARY": [
      "CLAIM_SUCCESS"
    ],
    "CLAIM_SUCCESS": []
  },
  "screens": [
    {
      "id": "FIND_TAG",
      "title": "🇳🇬 Find your ₦Tag",
      "data": {},
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Image",
            "src": "https://nairatag-network.vercel.app/hub/banner-card.jpg",
            "scale-type": "contain"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextHeading",
            "text": "✨ Claim your ₦NAIRATAG"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextSubheading",
            "text": "Your sovereign name for the onchain economy."
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBody",
            "text": "Check if your preferred **₦Tag** is available, claim your identity, and instantly unlock your **Base wallet** ⛓️, **Flutterwave Virtual Account** 🏦, and welcome vouchers 🎁.\n\n*Popular Suggestions:*\n• `₦Michael`  • `₦Ola`  • `₦Chioma`\n• `₦boy864`   • `₦Musa`  • `₦Bola`",
            "markdown": true
          },
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "search_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextInput",
                "name": "tag_name",
                "label": "₦ Enter handle (e.g. michael, chioma)",
                "required": true,
                "input-type": "text",
                "pattern": "^[₦]?[a-zA-Z0-9_]{3,20}$",
                "helper-text": "No need to type ₦ • 3-20 characters (letters, numbers, _)"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "🔍 Check Availability ⚡",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "navigate",
                  "next": {
                    "name": "CLAIM_SUMMARY",
                    "type": "screen"
                  },
                  "payload": {
                    "tag_input": "${form.tag_name}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CLAIM_SUMMARY",
      "title": "⚡ Claim your ₦Tag",
      "data": {
        "tag_input": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Michael"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "TextHeading",
            "text": "🟢 AVAILABLE & READY TO MINT ⚡"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextSubheading",
            "text": "This handle is available. Be the first to make it yours!"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBody",
            "text": "What you get when you claim:\n\n* 🆔 **Verified Protocol Handle** 💎\n* ⛓️ **Base Onchain Wallet** 🚀\n* 🏦 **Dedicated Flutterwave NUBAN Account** 💳\n* 🎁 **₦1,000 Welcome Voucher** 🎟️\n* ⚡ **Instant P2P Settlements** 💸\n* 🔗 **Shareable Web Profile (nairatag.ng)** 🌐",
            "markdown": true
          },
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "claim_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "🎉 Claim ₦Tag Now 🚀",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "navigate",
                  "next": {
                    "name": "CLAIM_SUCCESS",
                    "type": "screen"
                  },
                  "payload": {
                    "confirmed_tag": "${data.tag_input}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CLAIM_SUCCESS",
      "title": "🎉 Success!",
      "data": {
        "confirmed_tag": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Michael"
        }
      },
      "terminal": true,
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Image",
            "src": "https://nairatag-network.vercel.app/hub/banner-card.jpg",
            "scale-type": "contain"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextHeading",
            "text": "🎊 🥳 ₦${data.confirmed_tag} is Live! 🍾 🎉"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextSubheading",
            "text": "Your NairaTag has been successfully claimed & minted."
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBody",
            "text": "🎊 *Toss the confetti!* **₦${data.confirmed_tag}** is officially yours! ✨\n\n* 📱 **WhatsApp Identity**: Verified & linked\n* ⛓️ **Base Wallet**: 0x7a3...91c4 (Active)\n* 🏦 **Flutterwave Account**: Ready for deposits\n* 🎁 **₦1,000 Voucher**: Credited to your account\n\nShare your ₦Tag with your friends and start receiving payments instantly! 🚀",
            "markdown": true
          },
          {
            "type": "Footer",
            "label": "🎊 Done 🥳",
            "on-click-action": {
              "name": "complete",
              "payload": {
                "tag": "${data.confirmed_tag}"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
